<p>By gorging yourself on up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> stacks of Bleak Outcome from a creature, you turn into an Ominous Shadow for one turn per stack.</p><p>While transformed you are invisible (power <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">40, 54, 65, 74, 82</acronym>), convert 100% of all damage done to darkness and gain darkness resistance penetration and damage increase equal to your highest.</p><p>While transformed you can not apply new Bleak Outcome stacks.</p>